  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: thebeansbecomespilt
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236574
    - rid: 1790118649019236576
    - rid: 1790118649019236577
    - rid: 1790118649019236579
    - rid: 1790118649019236580
    - rid: 1790118649019236581
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, we''re back!'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236582
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: At Monika's call, {mc} emerges from his room.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236583
    - rid: 1790118649019236584
    - rid: 1790118649019236585
    - rid: 1790118649019236586
    - rid: 1790118649019236587
    - rid: 1790118649019236589
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, you look like crap! Have you eaten at all today?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236590
    - rid: 1790118649019236591
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Nah, I didn't really feel hungry.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506881
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Is your stomach upset or something, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506880
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: No.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506882
    - rid: 1790118673552506883
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Um, there was something we needed to talk about as a group, right?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506884
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506885
    - rid: 1790118673552506886
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Look-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506887
    - rid: 1790118673552506888
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: None of this is real; not this world, not me, and not any of you.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506889
    - rid: 1790118673552506897
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506890
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: This is all just some game, us being here is just for the entertainment
      of an actually real person.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506893
    - rid: 1790118673552506895
    - rid: 1790118673552506896
    - rid: 1790118673552506898
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506894
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: You-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506910
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: You can't be serious!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506901
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I am; Monika is too, isn't she?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506902
    - rid: 1790118673552506904
    - rid: 1790118673552506905
    - rid: 1790118673552506911
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: What could you have possibly seen to make you think that?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506903
    - rid: 1790118673552506912
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I saw the player <i>and</i> spoke to the person who orchestrated our
      lives-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506906
    - rid: 1790118673552506907
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Or rather, who orchestrated these past two weeks, since our lives before
      that are quite literally <i>just</i> memories.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506908
    - rid: 1790118673552506909
    - rid: 1790118673552506965
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: That's-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506966
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Prove it! Prove you spoke to this player or whatever!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506967
    - rid: 1790118673552506968
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506969
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506970
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506973
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506976
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506984
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: That's-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307161
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: This is <NoiseText=3,1>bullshit</NoiseText>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307162
    - rid: 1790118692274307163
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ... when viewed through the lens of narrative, our group is a bit cliche,
      isn't it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307164
    - rid: 1790118692274307165
    - rid: 1790118692274307167
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: The queen bee, the friendly ditz, the cute mean girl, and a shy bookworm...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307168
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: You're taking this seriously, Yuri?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307169
    - rid: 1790118692274307171
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Well... yes.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307170
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Everything being just a game for some player makes way more sense than
      real people somehow finding themselves trapped in a video game world.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307173
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: What about you, Sayori? You can't be buying any of this, can you?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307174
    - rid: 1790118692274307175
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307176
    - rid: 1790118692274307178
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't want to believe it...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307177
    - rid: 1790118692274307179
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not even supposed to be here; the person who manipulated all of this
      had me replace the original {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307180
    - rid: 1790118692274307181
    - rid: 1790118692274307182
    - rid: 1790118692274307183
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, wait, wait, replaced {mc} when?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307184
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: The Monday before he joined our club, so you never knew the original
      {mc}, Natsuki.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307186
    - rid: 1790118692274307187
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not sure if that's better or not...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307188
    - rid: 1790118692274307189
    - rid: 1790118692274307190
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ... no...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307191
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah. I know, Sayori...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307193
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: That, no, but you act like {mc}, whenever I think of {mc}, I see you-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Close your eyes, Sayori.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307194
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Think of the earliest memory you have with me, get as clear picture of
      me as a child in your head.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: What color are my eyes, Sayori?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ... Yellow-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: -!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307195
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And there you have it, not me.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307196
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The only reason I was able to become friends with you people is just
      a lie.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307197
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307200
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
